    - target: {fileID: 2298647161643049540, guid: 0222a1b4f9c504f4cb194ba535c119ea, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "That\u2019s Correct!\r\n\r\nBy simply looking at the equation, we can
        already infer the value. Since the numerator 2 must become 1 to match the
        fraction \\frac{1}{4}, the denominator must become 8, because \\frac{2}{8}
        = \\frac{1}{4}. Thus, we can expect that C(n,1) = 8.\r\n\r\nTherefore\r\n\r\nn
        = 8"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
